 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hnTWJNcO0mAQ7kNvwGTKdYw&_nc_oc=AdpzcHAy_uMqyN8e71hCQRyRqE9M2GduLIMKzrwQ9mlkpMD7m4GfXf0caq4LIesJu9k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOBU2CfJmPpoJQ32H2oVIN1DY3kClG0xs-pVN86q8C-CA&oe=6ADF6F41"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Xd2rFTZgvUcQ7kNvwEbFhvg&_nc_oc=AdoC1iz_4xq1vr9Yi1Z_ROsT5eDGznRt9Xh5d7CxzgC2hQuoNgLNsDTo8GkFKyOm1Ms&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNE8zxp8uksB6vvKLP3Abspyed-yf4gNg8gsFJU3966Tw&oe=6ADF4466"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZKgAIBoRBAcQ7kNvwFpNaou&_nc_oc=AdpOQrZM_lUJQHdlNpLIvMweGGx0h2wYWpVQsISy-6_3uVFHuZ1lFMDvi0bEspwS9AU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQON8IFbgAmLWVjGhsQN6GX6e4hyvJDDL772KsKlXvloUQ&oe=6ADF4E5C"}, {"fil